{"4751020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Launching to Stop the Enemy's Final Fleet", "steam_appid": 4751020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751020/extras/53097eca8b50ee65920fda2d163cd96e.avif?t=1786962409\" width=920 height=430 /></span><strong>Launching to Stop the Enemy’s Final Fleet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy’s final fleet is approaching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the skies, defend humanity’s last stronghold, and fight through relentless waves of enemy forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>11 unique aircraft</strong>, each equipped with its own weapons and special abilities. Defend your base, team up with other pilots, or challenge players from around the world in fast-paced online air combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the battlefield is in your hands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✈ 11 Unique Aircraft</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every aircraft offers a different combat style and special ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master powerful weapons including lasers, nuclear strikes, EMP attacks, guided missiles, energy shields, stealth systems, healing support, and more to create your own strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌐 Online Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle alongside friends or compete against players from around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer cooperation or competition, every match is a new challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🛡 Single Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your base against relentless enemy fleets in a solo tower defense experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751020/extras/407e734beaa4454717d2a41a4496ee07.poster.avif?t=1786962409\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751020/extras/407e734beaa4454717d2a41a4496ee07.webm?t=1786962409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751020/extras/407e734beaa4454717d2a41a4496ee07.mp4?t=1786962409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🤝 Co-op Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with other pilots to protect your base from increasingly powerful enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751020/extras/69a37f7fae13bd88fd2ef440078f3590.poster.avif?t=1786962409\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751020/extras/69a37f7fae13bd88fd2ef440078f3590.webm?t=1786962409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751020/extras/69a37f7fae13bd88fd2ef440078f3590.mp4?t=1786962409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚔ Free-for-All (Up to 8 Players)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against up to eight players in an intense online dogfight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the strongest pilot will claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751020/extras/396eecb5e475b1935be39b87ef9e7213.poster.avif?t=1786962409\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751020/extras/396eecb5e475b1935be39b87ef9e7213.webm?t=1786962409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751020/extras/396eecb5e475b1935be39b87ef9e7213.mp4?t=1786962409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🏆 Arena (8 players · 4v4)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two teams (Blue vs Red) each send out one pilot at a time for 1v1 duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across four 1v1 matches, the team with more wins claims victory. Every pilot's performance decides the team's fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751020/extras/60d72b7b75cda7fb3a5afdb1a7732785.poster.avif?t=1786962409\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751020/extras/60d72b7b75cda7fb3a5afdb1a7732785.webm?t=1786962409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751020/extras/60d72b7b75cda7fb3a5afdb1a7732785.mp4?t=1786962409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎖 Collect 99 Emblems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and collect <strong>99 unique emblems</strong> to customize and strengthen your aircraft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different combinations and build your own combat style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🏅 26 Collectible Badges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A symbol of your skill and journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn a variety of badges by leveling up or reaching ranks from Good to Legendary in Single, Co-op, and Free-for-All modes. Equip your favorite badge on your profile and show yourself off to players around the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚀 Fast-Paced Arcade Flight Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, challenging to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick reflexes, smart skill usage, precise aiming, and teamwork will determine who dominates the skies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy’s final fleet is closing in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Launch. Fight. Defend humanity.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751020/extras/53097eca8b50ee65920fda2d163cd96e.avif?t=1786962409\" width=920 height=430 /></span><strong>Launching to Stop the Enemy’s Final Fleet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy’s final fleet is approaching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the skies, defend humanity’s last stronghold, and fight through relentless waves of enemy forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>11 unique aircraft</strong>, each equipped with its own weapons and special abilities. Defend your base, team up with other pilots, or challenge players from around the world in fast-paced online air combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the battlefield is in your hands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✈ 11 Unique Aircraft</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every aircraft offers a different combat style and special ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master powerful weapons including lasers, nuclear strikes, EMP attacks, guided missiles, energy shields, stealth systems, healing support, and more to create your own strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌐 Online Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle alongside friends or compete against players from around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer cooperation or competition, every match is a new challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🛡 Single Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your base against relentless enemy fleets in a solo tower defense experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751020/extras/407e734beaa4454717d2a41a4496ee07.poster.avif?t=1786962409\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751020/extras/407e734beaa4454717d2a41a4496ee07.webm?t=1786962409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751020/extras/407e734beaa4454717d2a41a4496ee07.mp4?t=1786962409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🤝 Co-op Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with other pilots to protect your base from increasingly powerful enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751020/extras/69a37f7fae13bd88fd2ef440078f3590.poster.avif?t=1786962409\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751020/extras/69a37f7fae13bd88fd2ef440078f3590.webm?t=1786962409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751020/extras/69a37f7fae13bd88fd2ef440078f3590.mp4?t=1786962409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚔ Free-for-All (Up to 8 Players)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against up to eight players in an intense online dogfight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the strongest pilot will claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_parag