ur skill and journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn a variety of badges by leveling up or reaching ranks from Good to Legendary in Single, Co-op, and Free-for-All modes. Equip your favorite badge on your profile and show yourself off to players around the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚀 Fast-Paced Arcade Flight Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, challenging to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick reflexes, smart skill usage, precise aiming, and teamwork will determine who dominates the skies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy’s final fleet is closing in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Launch. Fight. Defend humanity.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Pilot 11 unique aircraft, defend your base, and battle other players in online co-op tower defense and up to 8-player PvP in this 3D arcade flight combat game.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751020/537d5707186d2230d70fcd533f7532e10e2953f2/header.jpg?t=1786962409", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751020/190715c0086cc92650ffb1a65e75028e4793947d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786962409", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751020/190715c0086cc92650ffb1a65e75028e4793947d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786962409", "website": "https://www.rdsoft.info", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100 / AMD Ryzen 3 3200G (quad-core)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel UHD 630 / NVIDIA GeForce GT